        "validation": {
          "proof": "By day 7: at least 15 quote requests from clinics that have not yet filed this year and at least 3 wins at $340. At 15 requests a week through day 22 that is about 49 quotes and 14 wins at 9 of 30; even at the proof's floor, 10 wins ($3,400) are reached by about day 16.",
